<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>VoiceKit — UX 라이팅 가이드 빌더</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
<link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard/dist/web/static/pretendard.css" rel="stylesheet" />
<style>
/* ─── Reset & Base ─── */
*, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
:root {
  --ink: #111110;
  --ink-2: #444440;
  --ink-3: #888882;
  --ink-4: #c0bfb8;
  --paper: #FFFFFF;
  --paper-2: #F7F7F7;
  --paper-3: #EBEBEB;
  --mint: #5135FF;
  --mint-light: #EDEAFF;
  --mint-mid: #9B8BFF;
  --red: #c8402a;
  --red-light: #faeae6;
  --border: rgba(17,17,16,0.1);
  --border-strong: rgba(17,17,16,0.2);
  --radius: 10px;
  --radius-lg: 16px;
  --shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.06), 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);
  --shadow-lg: 0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.08), 0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);
}
html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
body {
  font-family: 'Pretendard', -apple-system, sans-serif;
  background: var(--paper);
  color: var(--ink);
  line-height: 1.6;
  font-size: 15px;
  min-height: 100vh;
}
h1,h2,h3,h4 { line-height: 1.3; }
input, textarea, select { font-family: inherit; }
button { font-family: inherit; cursor: pointer; }
a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }

/* ─── Layout ─── */
.container { max-width: 960px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 2rem; }
.container-wide { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 2rem; }

/* ─── Header ─── */
.site-header {
  position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 100;
  background: rgba(250,250,248,0.92);
  backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
}
.header-inner {
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
  padding: 1rem 2rem; max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto;
}
.logo {
  display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 8px;
}
.logo-mark {
  font-family: 'Pretendard', sans-serif;
  font-size: 20px; color: var(--ink);
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: -0.03em;
}
.logo-sub {
  font-size: 11px; color: var(--ink-3); font-weight: 400;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase;
}
.step-indicator {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0;
}
.step-pip {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
  padding: 6px 12px;
  font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--ink-3);
  border-radius: 100px;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: all 0.15s;
}
.step-pip:hover { color: var(--ink-2); }
.step-pip.active { color: var(--mint); }
.step-pip.done { color: var(--ink-2); }
.step-pip .pip-dot {
  width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--ink-4); flex-shrink: 0;
  transition: all 0.15s;
}
.step-pip.active .pip-dot { background: var(--mint); }
.step-pip.done .pip-dot { background: var(--ink-2); }
.step-divider { width: 16px; height: 1px; background: var(--border); }

/* ─── Hero ─── */
.hero {
  padding: 4rem 0 3rem;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  animation: fadeUp 0.5s ease both;
}
.hero-label {
  font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--mint); margin-bottom: 1rem;
}
.hero-title {
  font-family: 'Pretendard', sans-serif;
  font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 2.8vw, 2.2rem);
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--ink); letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  margin-bottom: 1rem; max-width: 680px; line-height: 1.35;
}
.hero-title em { font-style: normal; color: var(--ink-2); font-weight: 300; }
.hero-desc {
  font-size: 15px; color: var(--ink-2); max-width: 480px;
  line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 2rem;
}
.hero-steps {
  display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap;
}
.hero-step-item {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
  font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-3);
}
.hero-step-num {
  width: 22px; height: 22px; border-radius: 50%;
  border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink-2);
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

/* ─── Main Content ─── */
.main-layout {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 220px 1fr;
  gap: 0;
  min-height: calc(100vh - 140px);
}
.sidebar {
  border-right: 1px solid var(--border);
  padding: 2rem 0;
  position: sticky; top: 57px; align-self: start;
  height: calc(100vh - 57px);
  overflow-y: auto;
}
.sidebar-nav { padding: 0 1.25rem; }
.sidebar-section-label {
  font-size: 10px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink-4);
  padding: 0 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; margin-top: 1.5rem;
}
.sidebar-section-label:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
.nav-item {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
  padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: var(--radius);
  font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; color: var(--ink-3);
  cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.12s;
  margin-bottom: 2px;
}
.nav-item:hover { background: var(--paper-2); color: var(--ink-2); }
.nav-item.active { background: var(--mint-light); color: var(--mint); font-weight: 500; }
.nav-item.done { color: var(--ink-2); }
.nav-item .nav-check {
  width: 16px; height: 16px; border-radius: 50%;
  border: 1.5px solid var(--border-strong);
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 9px; transition: all 0.15s;
}
.nav-item.active .nav-check { border-color: var(--mint); background: var(--mint); color: #fff; }
.nav-item.done .nav-check { border-color: var(--ink-2); background: var(--ink-2); color: #fff; }

.content-area { padding: 2.5rem; }

/* ─── Panels ─── */
.panel { display: none; animation: fadeUp 0.3s ease both; }
.panel.active { display: block; }
@keyframes fadeUp {
  from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(12px); }
  to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
}

.panel-header { margin-bottom: 2rem; }
.panel-eyebrow {
  font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--mint); margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
}
.panel-title {
  font-family: 'Pretendard', sans-serif;
  font-size: 1.8rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
}
.panel-desc { font-size: 14px; color: var(--ink-3); line-height: 1.7; max-width: 520px; }
.source-tag {
  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px;
  padding: 3px 8px; background: var(--paper-2);
  border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 100px;
  font-size: 11px; color: var(--ink-3); margin-top: 8px;
}

/* ─── Form Elements ─── */
.field-group { margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
.field-label {
  display: block; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--ink-2); margin-bottom: 6px; letter-spacing: 0.02em;
}
.field-input {
  width: 100%; padding: 10px 14px;
  border: 1px solid var(--border-strong); border-radius: var(--radius);
  background: #fff; color: var(--ink); font-size: 14px;
  transition: border-color 0.15s, box-shadow 0.15s; outline: none;
}
.field-input:focus { border-color: var(--mint); box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(81,53,255,0.1); }
.field-input::placeholder { color: var(--ink-4); }

/* ─── Trait Cards ─── */
.trait-grid {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1rem;
  margin-bottom: 2rem;
}
.trait-card {
  background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 1.25rem;
  transition: border-color 0.15s;
}
.trait-card:hover { border-color: var(--border-strong); }
.trait-card-label {
  font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink-3); margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
}
.trait-opts { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; }
.trait-opt {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
  padding: 7px 10px; border-radius: 8px;
  border: 1px solid transparent;
  cursor: pointer; font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-2);
  transition: all 0.12s;
}
.trait-opt:hover { background: var(--paper-2); }
.trait-opt.selected { background: var(--mint-light); border-color: rgba(81,53,255,0.3); color: var(--mint); font-weight: 500; }
.trait-opt input[type=radio] { display: none; }
.trait-opt-dot {
  width: 14px; height: 14px; border-radius: 50%;
  border: 1.5px solid var(--border-strong); flex-shrink: 0;
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  transition: all 0.12s;
}
.trait-opt.selected .trait-opt-dot { border-color: var(--mint); background: var(--mint); }
.trait-opt.selected .trait-opt-dot::after {
  content: ''; width: 5px; height: 5px; border-radius: 50%; background: #fff;
}

/* ─── Matrix Sliders ─── */
.matrix-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
.matrix-card {
  background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 1.25rem;
}
.matrix-card-title {
  font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 1rem;
}
.matrix-ends {
  display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 6px;
}
.matrix-end { font-size: 11px; color: var(--ink-3); }
.matrix-slider {
  width: 100%; height: 4px; border-radius: 2px;
  outline: none; appearance: none; background: var(--paper-3);
  cursor: pointer;
}
.matrix-slider::-webkit-slider-thumb {
  appearance: none; width: 18px; height: 18px; border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--mint); border: 2px solid #fff;
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 1.5px var(--mint), 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);
  cursor: grab; transition: transform 0.1s;
}
.matrix-slider::-webkit-slider-thumb:active { transform: scale(1.15); cursor: grabbing; }
.matrix-val {
  text-align: center; margin-top: 8px;
  font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--mint);
}

/* ─── Buttons ─── */
.btn {
  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
  padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: var(--radius);
  font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500;
  border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
  background: transparent; color: var(--ink-2);
  transition: all 0.12s;
}
.btn:hover { background: var(--paper-2); }
.btn:active { transform: scale(0.98); }
.btn-primary {
  background: var(--ink); color: #fff; border-color: var(--ink);
}
.btn-primary:hover { background: var(--ink-2); border-color: var(--ink-2); }
.btn-mint {
  background: var(--mint); color: #fff; border-color: var(--mint);
}
.btn-mint:hover { background: #3318E0; border-color: #3318E0; }
.btn-row { display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; gap: 8px; padding-top: 1.5rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); margin-top: 2rem; }

/* ─── Voice Chart Table ─── */
.vc-table-wrap { overflow-x: auto; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; border-radius: var(--radius-lg); border: 1px solid var(--border); }
.vc-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px; }
.vc-table th {
  background: var(--paper-2); padding: 10px 14px;
  text-align: left; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink-3);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
}
.vc-table td {
  padding: 12px 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  vertical-align: top; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--ink-2);
}
.vc-table tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
.vc-table tr:hover td { background: var(--paper-2); }
.vc-editable { cursor: text; transition: background 0.12s, outline 0.12s; outline: 2px solid transparent; border-radius: 4px; }
.vc-editable:hover { background: var(--mint-light) !important; }
.vc-editable:focus { outline: 2px solid var(--mint); background: #fff !important; }
.vc-table td:first-child { font-weight: 500; color: var(--ink); white-space: nowrap; }

/* ─── Guide Blocks ─── */
.guide-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
.guide-card {
  background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 1.25rem;
}
.guide-card-label {
  font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.06em;
  text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink-3); margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
}
.guide-card-body {
  font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-2); line-height: 1.7;
  white-space: pre-wrap;
}
.guide-card.do-card .guide-card-label { color: var(--mint); }
.guide-card.dont-card .guide-card-label { color: var(--red); }
.guide-card-full { background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
.guide-summary { font-size: 15px; color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.8; font-style: italic; }
.principle-list { list-style: none; }
.principle-item {
  display: flex; gap: 12px; padding: 8px 0;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-2);
}
.principle-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
.principle-num { font-weight: 600; color: var(--mint); flex-shrink: 0; width: 16px; }
.example-row { padding: 10px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
.example-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
.example-bad { font-size: 13px; color: var(--red); margin-bottom: 4px; }
.example-good { font-size: 13px; color: var(--mint); margin-bottom: 4px; }
.example-reason { font-size: 12px; color: var(--ink-3); }

/* ─── Check Area ─── */
.check-wrap { max-width: 640px; }
.check-tags { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
.check-tag {
  padding: 4px 10px; background: var(--paper-2); border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 100px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--ink-2);
}
.check-textarea {
  width: 100%; padding: 14px 16px; min-height: 120px; resize: vertical;
  border: 1px solid var(--border-strong); border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  background: #fff; color: var(--ink); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6;
  outline: none; transition: border-color 0.15s, box-shadow 0.15s; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
}
.check-textarea:focus { border-color: var(--mint); box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(81,53,255,0.1); }
.check-textarea::placeholder { color: var(--ink-4); }
.result-card {
  border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); overflow: hidden;
  margin-top: 1.25rem;
}
.result-card-header {
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
  padding: 12px 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
}
.result-card.pass .result-card-header { background: var(--mint-light); }
.result-card.fail .result-card-header { background: var(--red-light); }
.result-verdict { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; }
.result-card.pass .result-verdict { color: var(--mint); }
.result-card.fail .result-verdict { color: var(--red); }
.result-stars { font-size: 14px; color: var(--ink-3); }
.result-body { padding: 16px; background: #fff; }
.result-summary { font-size: 14px; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 0.75rem; line-height: 1.6; }
.result-issues { margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
.result-issue { font-size: 13px; color: var(--red); padding: 3px 0; }
.result-suggest-label { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink-3); margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 12px; padding-top: 12px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
.result-suggest { font-size: 14px; color: var(--mint); font-style: italic; }

/* ─── Loading ─── */
.loading-state {
  padding: 3rem; text-align: center;
  font-size: 14px; color: var(--ink-3);
}
.loading-spinner {
  width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 50%;
  border: 2px solid var(--paper-3); border-top-color: var(--mint);
  animation: spin 0.8s linear infinite; margin: 0 auto 1rem;
}
@keyframes spin { to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }

/* ─── Empty State ─── */
.empty-state {
  padding: 3rem; text-align: center; color: var(--ink-3);
}
.empty-icon { font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; opacity: 0.4; }
.empty-text { font-size: 14px; }

/* ─── Notification ─── */
.notif {
  position: fixed; bottom: 2rem; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);
  background: var(--ink); color: #fff; padding: 10px 20px;
  border-radius: 100px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500;
  opacity: 0; pointer-events: none;
  transition: opacity 0.2s; z-index: 200;
}
.notif.show { opacity: 1; }

/* ─── Responsive ─── */
@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .main-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .sidebar { position: static; height: auto; border-right: none; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); padding: 1rem 0; }
  .sidebar-nav { display: flex; gap: 4px; overflow-x: auto; padding: 0 1rem; }
  .nav-item { white-space: nowrap; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .sidebar-section-label { display: none; }
  .trait-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  .matrix-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .guide-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .step-indicator { display: none; }
  .content-area { padding: 1.5rem; }
}
@media (max-width: 540px) {
  .trait-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- Header -->
<header class="site-header">
  <div class="header-inner">
    <div class="logo">
      <span class="logo-mark">VoiceKit</span>
      <span class="logo-sub">UX Writing Guide Builder</span>
    </div>
    <nav class="step-indicator" id="stepNav">
      <span class="step-pip active" onclick="goStep(1)" id="sp1"><span class="pip-dot"></span>브랜드 성격</span>
      <span class="step-divider"></span>
      <span class="step-pip" onclick="goStep(2)" id="sp2"><span class="pip-dot"></span>보이스 매트릭스</span>
      <span class="step-divider"></span>
      <span class="step-pip" onclick="goStep(3)" id="sp3"><span class="pip-dot"></span>보이스 차트</span>
      <span class="step-divider"></span>
      <span class="step-pip" onclick="goStep(4)" id="sp4"><span class="pip-dot"></span>가이드</span>
      <span class="step-divider"></span>
      <span class="step-pip" onclick="goStep(5)" id="sp5"><span class="pip-dot"></span>문장 검수</span>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- Hero (Step 1 only) -->
<div id="heroSection">
  <div class="container" style="padding-top:3rem;padding-bottom:3rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);">
    <div class="hero-label">Design Tool</div>
    <h1 class="hero-title">브랜드 보이스부터 문장 검수까지,<br><em>UX 라이팅 기준을 한 곳에서 만드세요.</em></h1>
    <div class="hero-steps">
      <div class="hero-step-item"><span class="hero-step-num">1</span>브랜드 성격 묘사</div>
      <div class="hero-step-item"><span class="hero-step-num">2</span>보이스 매트릭스</div>
      <div class="hero-step-item"><span class="hero-step-num">3</span>보이스 차트 생성</div>
      <div class="hero-step-item"><span class="hero-step-num">4</span>라이팅 가이드 완성</div>
      <div class="hero-step-item"><span class="hero-step-num">5</span>AI 문장 검수</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- Main Layout -->
<div class="container-wide">
  <div class="main-layout">
    <!-- Sidebar -->
    <aside class="sidebar">
      <nav class="sidebar-nav">
        <div class="sidebar-section-label">설정</div>
        <div class="nav-item active" onclick="goStep(1)" id="ni1">
          <span class="nav-check" id="nc1"></span> 브랜드 성격 묘사
        </div>
        <div class="nav-item" onclick="goStep(2)" id="ni2">
          <span class="nav-check" id="nc2"></span> 보이스 매트릭스
        </div>
        <div class="sidebar-section-label">생성</div>
        <div class="nav-item" onclick="goStep(3)" id="ni3">
          <span class="nav-check" id="nc3"></span> 보이스 차트
        </div>
        <div class="nav-item" onclick="goStep(4)" id="ni4">
          <span class="nav-check" id="nc4"></span> 라이팅 가이드
        </div>
        <div class="sidebar-section-label">검수</div>
        <div class="nav-item" onclick="goStep(5)" id="ni5">
          <span class="nav-check" id="nc5"></span> 문장 검수
        </div>
      </nav>
    </aside>

    <!-- Content -->
    <main class="content-area">

      <!-- ── Panel 1: 브랜드 성격 ── -->
      <section class="panel active" id="panel1">
